            <note corresp="#d174-f3" n="3" xml:id="d174-f3-content">
                <p>Not found attached; however, a copy is attached to a January 21 memorandum from
                        Ridgway to Shultz in preparation for his January 22
                    meeting with Dobrynin. (Reagan Library,
                        George Shultz Papers, 1986 Soviet
                    Union Jan.) See <ref target="#d184">Document 184</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d174-f4" n="4" xml:id="d174-f4-content">
                <p>On December 27, 1985, terrorists attacked the El Al check-in counters at the
                    Vienna and Rome airports.</p>
            </note>
